        <provenance:importDate rdf:datatype="&xsd;dateTime">2013-05-07T16:09:02</provenance:importDate>
        <provenance:importDate rdf:datatype="&xsd;dateTime">2013-05-08T19:16:03</provenance:importDate>
        <bioportal:ontologyId rdf:datatype="&xsd;int">46896</bioportal:ontologyId>
        <provenance:ontologyName rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">DILo Clinical Terms Branch (subset of SNOMED Clinical Terms)</provenance:ontologyName>
        <provenance:importCreator rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">J Sluka</provenance:importCreator>
        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Some of the class names have been changed to correspond to the prefered names in SNOMED of 7/31/2011.
In DILIo publication -&gt; in this file
Disorder of liver -&gt; Disease of liver
Finding of general form of body -&gt; General form of body - finding
Finding of size of liver -&gt; size of liver - finding
Subacute necrosis of liver -&gt; subacute hepatic necrosis</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Wang, Y. et al., &quot;A Unifying Ontology to Integrate Histological and Clinical Observations for Drug-Induce Liver Injury&quot;, The American Journal of Pathology, 182:4, 1180-1187 (2013).</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


